   "text": "Swinburne University - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nSwinburne University - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nSwinburne University of Technology is based in Melbourne and was founded in 1908.In the 2020 QS World University Rankings, Swinburne was ranked 43rd for art and design, making it one of the top art and design schools in Australia and the world, and was ranked top 100 in the field of physics by the Academic Ranking of World Universities.\nSwinburne Academy provide a route for international students into Swinburne University via its pathway program.\nCRICOS Provider Code: 00111D.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 11:47\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 11:47\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$28,461.00\nMin: A$22,742.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n500 of 5,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nUP Education\nFounded Year\n1908\nCampus(es)\nMelbourne\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nIndia, Nepal, Bangladesh, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/02/2025\nContract End Date\n31/01/2027\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kC8B0vSfpVg\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
